<title>USA: Datapoint Q3 April 26 profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Datapoint Q3 April 26 profit vs loss.</headline>
<text>
<p>SAN ANTONIO, June 2 (Reuter)</p>
<p>				1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.05     loss	 $0.33</p>
<p> Net profit		 1,064     loss	 3,994</p>
<p> Revs			37,760		   46,803</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  17,719		   13,472</p>
<p>	  9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.18     loss	 $0.49</p>
<p> Net profit		 2,743     loss	 6,553</p>
<p> Revs		     105,021		  135,674</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  15,579		   13,359</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: Nine-month 1997 results include $3.8 million gain from exchange and retirement of preferred stock, and a $0.07 per share extraordinary credit for debt extinguishment.</p>
<p>Excluding those gains, company had a net loss of $238,000 for the nine-month period, compared to a loss of $5.1 million for the same period the year before.</p>
<p>Decline in revenue for Q3 and nine-months 1997 mostly due to sale of company's European-based Automotive Dealer Management Systems business in Q4 1996.</p>
</text>
